Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:04.67,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In an era in which the nations of \Nthe world were waging a fierce war
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:06.24,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,of information just out of sight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:09.62,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,two countries were at odds with \Neach other: Ostania, in the east,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:11.03,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and Westalis, in the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.77,0:00:14.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In order to keep an eye on the actions of \Na leading figure in Ostania's government
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:16.07,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,who was planning a war,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:19.76,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Westalis set Operation Strix in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:23.34,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The one tasked with this operation \Nis the skilled agent, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.69,0:00:26.85,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The mission given to the master of \Ndisguise with a hundred faces was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:28.89,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,to start a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.93,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The father, Loid Forger, is a psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:35.12,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,His true identity: a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:37.00,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Code name: Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:40.65,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The mother, Yor Forger, is a civil \Nservant who works at city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:43.28,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Her true identity: an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:45.10,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Code name: Thorn Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:48.08,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The daughter, Anya Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:51.32,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Her true identity: a telepath \Nwho can read people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:53.90,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The dog, Bond Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:57.76,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,His true identity: a canine seer \Nwho can see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.48,0:01:01.32,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,They created this pretend \Nfamily for their own benefit,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:05.79,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and their mission continues as they all \Nhide their identities from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:00.41,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.16,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The customers have been served.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:09.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I'm heading home immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:14.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My husband asked me to buy \Nmilk and eggs on my way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.17,0:03:21.58,italics,Em,0,0,0,,Damn it... So she's the famous assassin \Nknown as the Thorn Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:22.72,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.74,0:03:28.05,main,Em,0,0,0,,Die, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:38.23,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx89\pos(355,285)\fad(1,513)}FOLLOW MAMA AND PAPA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:39.73,italicstop,News,0,0,0,,We've just received breaking news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:43.73,italicstop,News,0,0,0,,Several bodies believed to belong \Nto members of the Red Circus
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.73,0:03:46.60,italicstop,News,0,0,0,,have been found in a building \Nin the Northern District.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:49.87,italicstop,News,0,0,0,,The Red Circus, an extremist group \Nfunded by foreign interests,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:48.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:51.98,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wanna watch cartoons. The news is boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:52.78,italicstop,News,0,0,0,,has committed multiple \Nindiscriminate acts of terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:52.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:57.41,italicstop,News,0,0,0,,The authorities are investigating \Nthis incident as one caused
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:58.71,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There's so much information I can gather \Njust from a single public news outlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.41,0:03:59.40,italicstop,News,0,0,0,,by internal strife within the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.51,0:04:03.57,italicstop,News,0,0,0,,Next up, we have stock market news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.43,0:04:04.34,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. You can change the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:07.35,italicstop,News,0,0,0,,In today's stock market, \Nwe see a drastic drop
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:09.53,italicstop,News,0,0,0,,from where the numbers were \Nbefore the weekend...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:13.32,italics,Boss,0,0,0,,Good morning, Bondman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.32,0:04:16.52,italics,Boss,0,0,0,,Your mission today is to \Ntail a certain target.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:20.75,italicstop,Boss,0,0,0,,You will then find out where they \Nare keeping their secret weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,So exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.75,0:04:23.65,italicstop,Boss,0,0,0,,and destroy it in order \Nto protect our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.86,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:27.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Yor—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:44.17,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Here—hngh—is the milk... and the eggs...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:47.17,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, uh... Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:50.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Um... Are you feeling unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:52.57,main,Yor,0,0,0,,No, not exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.57,0:04:55.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm just a little... No...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:56.76,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I can't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:05:00.39,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I absolutely cannot tell him \Nthat I got shot in the butt
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:03.69,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,while fighting a group of armed men,\N and it hurts so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:05.93,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I mean, I took care of it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:11.00,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Sh... She was shot? By a {\i0}gun{\i1}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:15.85,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama... Are you going to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:18.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:19.39,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:24.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm a bit tired, so I'm going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:29.14,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm sure that... if I get \Na good night's sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:32.54,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,it'll be better in the morning... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.89,0:05:42.51,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Y-Yor is in a terrible mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.51,0:05:44.65,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is it because I asked her to go shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:45.75,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes, that must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:48.76,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This is just a marriage of convenience, \Nyet I've been relying on her
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:51.28,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,too much without realizing it, \Nand it's upset her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.43,0:05:54.99,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama won't die even if \Nshe's been shot {\i0}with a gun{\i1}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.99,0:05:55.91,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:05:58.03,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This not good. Not good at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:00.43,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Any discord in our family will \Nlead to this mission failing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:03.41,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I must do everything in my \Npower to remedy this at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.41,0:06:05.27,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa has missed the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:09.86,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Hopefully her mood will be \Nbetter in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:22.63,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It didn't get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:22.63,italicstop,Yor,0,0,0,,It didn't get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.97,0:06:27.81,main,Yor,0,0,0,,G-Good morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.61,0:06:30.03,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:32.85,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I... I need to brighten her mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.85,0:06:35.54,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor! We're both off today, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:39.13,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Why don't we go on a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,A d-d...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:45.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I want to thank you for always helping \Nme with raising Anya and the chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:48.04,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'd like you to relax to the utmost today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.45,main,Yor,0,0,0,,A date...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:54.12,flashback,Millie,0,0,0,,My boyfriend took me out \Non a cruise the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:57.42,flashback,Millie,0,0,0,,What kind of dates do you go on, Yor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:59.50,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? I've never been on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:03.34,flashback,Camilla,0,0,0,,No way. Surely you and \Nyour husband go on dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:06.32,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.43,0:07:11.45,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I must at least experience \Nthis thing they call a "date,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:14.74,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,or someone may suspect that \Nwe're a pretend family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.74,0:07:19.13,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Um... We don't have to go \Nif you're not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:22.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I will go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:26.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I would like to take this opportunity \Nto learn everything that I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:27.46,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:30.99,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll go change right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:34.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants to go, too! \NDates are so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:37.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, sorry, but you're staying home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:38.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Because it's a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.58,0:07:40.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:42.19,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Poo...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:45.06,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:52.99,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right, be good while we're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:55.25,main,Franky,0,0,0,,C'mere a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.67,0:08:01.30,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Okay, hang on! How many \Ntimes do I have to tell you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.30,0:08:04.47,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I'm an informant, not your errand boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.47,0:08:05.72,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I had no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:08.58,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I can't leave Anya home alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:12.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,and this is a very important mission to \Nensure that we remain one happy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:15.70,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You said you wanted to create \Nsome new spy gadgets, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.70,0:08:17.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I've already prepared you a check. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:20.85,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Must you take advantage of \Nmy weakness every single time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:25.06,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right, let's go, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:33.86,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Allow me to take your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:41.63,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Last night, I came up with 862 date \Nplans to ensure that Yor has fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:42.61,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There's no way I could fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.37,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Um... I'm terribly sorry, Loid...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.88,0:08:54.56,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Sitting down would mean my \Nbutt will be in even more pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:57.10,main,Yor,0,0,0,,But I'd prefer if we just \Nwalked around on this date.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.97,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?! She's mad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:00.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She's still mad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:04.64,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This just killed 794 of those plans!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.93,0:09:07.17,main,Loid,0,0,0,,O-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:09.52,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Then let's just take a casual little stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:15.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Mama and Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:19.49,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Well, if they've got a kid like you \Nworried about them, they're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:22.41,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Come on and watch some \Ncartoons inside, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:25.47,main,Boss,0,0,0,,Go, Bondman!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:28.17,main,Boss,0,0,0,,Follow him and protect world peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:29.75,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Scruffy Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:31.57,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:35.18,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I want to tail Mama and Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:45.09,main,Franky,0,0,0,,What the hell? That sounds like\Nsome epic fun! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.09,0:09:46.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Let's tail them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.77,0:09:49.28,main,Franky,0,0,0,,But your Papa's pretty sharp,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:52.26,main,Franky,0,0,0,,so we're gonna have to be careful \Nand wear some disguises!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:52.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:02.88,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I think you're bringing even more \Nattention to yourself in that getup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.79,main,Anya,0,0,0,,No problemo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:06.33,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:09.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You've been charged with \Nguarding this house,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:14.32,main,Anya,0,0,0,,highly skilled agents of the \NSecret Organization P2!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:18.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Bond, Director Chimera, \Nand Agent Penguinman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:32.08,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Twilight, I'm gonna get a good \Nlook at the romance skills
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:34.52,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,that have landed you countless women!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:36.56,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I can't read their minds.\NThey're too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.60,0:10:39.91,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,What are those two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.07,sign_15334_156_Spotted_them_ins,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,280)\fs15}Spotted them instantly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:44.75,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is she pretending to be a spy again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:46.68,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,How is that even fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:49.99,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll just think of this as part \Nof the mission to keep our happy family,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:51.94,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,and pretend I haven't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.58,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll be fine \Nsince Franky's with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.58,0:10:56.78,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:59.00,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, er, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:01.58,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,More importantly, I need \Nto brighten her mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.42,top,Loid,0,0,0,,Why don't we go shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:05.60,sign_2226_17_CARRY_OUT_THE_GR,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\fnArial\pos(440,270)\fs26\fad(523,1)\bord4}Central Mall
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:12.61,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You have such a striking figure, Yor. \NI'm sure you'd look great in pants, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:14.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Would you like to try these on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:22.30,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If I wear anything that tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:25.20,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,it'll agitate my wound,\Nand I'll pass out in agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.65,0:11:26.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:29.09,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:33.50,sign_2226_17_CARRY_OUT_THE_GR,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(320,285)\fnArial\bord4\fs16\fad(774,1)}Movie Theater
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:36.32,italicstop,Movie Voice,0,0,0,,Oh, my beloved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:39.05,italicstop,Movie Voice,0,0,0,,Please look me in the eyes \Nand tell me you're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:39.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:43.67,italicstop,Movie Voice,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone else have \Nyour beautiful, proud soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:41.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You might make a scene.\NMaybe you should sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.97,0:11:44.02,main,Yor,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:45.77,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If I sit down, my butt...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:57.19,sign_2226_17_CARRY_OUT_THE_GR,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\bord4\fs20\fad(774,1)\pos(545,75)}Club
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:56.85,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If I sit down, my butt...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:01.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor, it's dangerous to stand up...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:04.20,sign_2226_17_CARRY_OUT_THE_GR,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\bord4\fs15\fad(774,1)\pos(544,72)}Pond at the Park
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:04.18,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But if I sit down, my butt...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:15.21,sign_2226_17_CARRY_OUT_THE_GR,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\an8\bord4\fs20\fad(774,1)\pos(85,72)}Spa
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:14.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:26.10,sign_2226_17_CARRY_OUT_THE_GR,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\bord4\fs20\fad(774,1)\pos(545,72)}Zoo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:26.10,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,My butt...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:37.59,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What should I do? I can't \Nconcentrate on this date at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:41.11,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,And here Loid is trying to \Nteach me so many things!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:42.24,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:45.44,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I think her mood is getting \Nworse rather than better!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.44,0:12:47.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Am I somehow picking all \Nthe wrong things to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.42,0:12:49.34,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What is it?! What exactly does Yor like?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:50.84,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Did I not do enough research?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.47,0:12:56.17,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Loid always tries to act cool, \Nbut he's failing left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:58.19,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Scruffy, scruffy, scruff. What a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.19,0:13:00.28,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Scruffy Head, does your personality suck?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:01.59,main,Franky,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:05.09,main,Franky,0,0,0,,As someone who can't get any girls, it's my \Nabsolute right to ridicule him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:05.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.84,0:13:07.65,main,Franky,0,0,0,,What'd you say, you little—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.65,0:13:10.26,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,They're starting to become a distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:12.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're a bit tired, \Nso why don't we have dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:13.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.97,0:13:20.52,main,Host,0,0,0,,Ah, you must be Mister Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:27.07,main,Host,0,0,0,,Please, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.12,0:13:43.09,main,Host,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:45.61,main,Host,0,0,0,,We have a strict dress \Ncode at our restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:50.51,main,Host,0,0,0,,and we also do not allow guests under \Neighteen into our establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.51,0:13:52.95,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Well, you heard the guy. Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:13:59.74,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Let's start heading home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.39,0:14:03.60,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I'm getting kinda bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:09.45,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,Th-Thorn Princess?! What the \Nhell is she doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.26,0:14:14.92,main,Franky,0,0,0,,What's up? You lookin' for a bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.44,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.97,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:24.50,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,That's the assassin woman who \Nraided our hideout yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.92,0:14:26.63,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,What's she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:30.90,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,When I survived that tragedy, \NI took it as God's mercy on my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.90,0:14:33.17,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,and I decided to turn over a \Nnew leaf and get a proper job
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:36.76,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,for the sake of the girlfriend \NI live with, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.93,0:14:42.18,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I see. I see how it is, my comrades in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:46.27,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I just need to kill her, right? \NI'll avenge the Red Circus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.27,0:14:48.19,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,There's a bad guy in the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:49.45,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Die, Thorn Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:52.63,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Hurgh! That's right! You're the \Nbest assassin ever! I am defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:56.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Y-Yor, you're an assassin? \NLet's get a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.15,0:14:58.20,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The Forgers are done.\NLet's get rid of Anya, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:15:00.00,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's get goin', kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:01.29,main,Anya,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:03.18,main,Franky,0,0,0,,What? Are we still playing this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.18,0:15:04.81,main,Anya,0,0,0,,My family's in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:06.21,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:10.45,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,Wait, is she worried that her parents \Nmight get divorced or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:13.05,italics,Franky,0,0,0,,She feels that strongly \Nabout a pretend family?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:17.92,main,Franky,0,0,0,,O-Okay, fine... I guess I'll play \Nthis game with you a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.72,0:15:20.93,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Okay, our next game is called "Infiltration"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:21.93,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Infillytration!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.33,0:15:24.85,main,Waiter,0,0,0,,Would you like an aperitif?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.85,0:15:27.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll have a glass of dry champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:30.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll just take a cocktail. Any is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:35.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,This restaurant serves a very rare delicacy \Ncalled "blowfish" from the far east.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:37.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I hear they serve it in \None of their courses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:40.40,main,Yor,0,0,0,,W-Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:46.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Blowfish is highly poisonous, \Nbut I'm told its flesh is quite exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:54.35,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Pardon, could you take this \Nto the lady at table 3?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:55.24,main,Waiter,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:59.68,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,Drink a whole fish's worth of blowfish \Npoison and go to hell, Thorn Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:01.97,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Scruffy Head, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:03.26,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You can't rush this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:06.79,main,Franky,0,0,0,,We gotta be careful when we're infiltrating. \NGet too loud, and they'll find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:10.37,main,Waiter,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:19.11,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, my. This has quite the color and aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:20.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And it's so thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:24.55,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama, you can't drink that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:40.15,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.55,0:16:44.14,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I've avenged you, my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:49.35,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It's like the pain in my butt has\N gone away! I feel so much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.35,0:16:52.57,italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,This woman had built up immunity to poisons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.17,0:16:55.60,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Though my whole body \Ndoes feel a bit tingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:56.65,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But I can sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:17:01.52,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get really hungry. \NI'm very excited to eat here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:03.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh? Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:07.66,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Is she in a better mood? \NIs it because of the drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:12.26,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait... I'm pretty sure \NI put in enough to kill her. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:19.68,sign_9163_143_Sis_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(50,295)\3c&H4B28B8&\shad0\fs19\fsp.2}* Blowfish poison is very dangerous, so please don't try this at home
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:15.41,italicstop,Narrator,0,0,0,,There's a fine line between \Npoison and medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:17.93,italicstop,Narrator,0,0,0,,Ordinary people should \Ntake recommended doses
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:19.68,italicstop,Narrator,0,0,0,,and follow directions \Nwhen using medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:23.68,main,Franky,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.41,0:17:30.53,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I guess I'll have to take \Nthings into my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:32.69,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I'll just finish her off myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.43,0:17:36.58,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I should be able to build a makeshift \Nbomb with the stuff in storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:38.78,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,With that and that and that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.91,0:17:43.70,sign_25341_276_THAT,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2500,1)}THAT
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:43.31,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I won't be able to include a timer, \Nso I'll just have to run into her with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:45.50,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:47.49,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for being such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:51.56,main,Franky,0,0,0,,We'll be right above the dining hall soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:55.63,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Once we're right above, \NI'll lower you down on a wire,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:58.47,main,Franky,0,0,0,,and you can hear what they're \Ntalking about... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.95,0:18:04.74,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I should be able to make the \Nbomb's body with **** and ****.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:06.91,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure they were \Non the right-hand shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:10.74,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,After I put in the blue **** that's \Non the opposite shelf and some ****.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:14.32,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,To make sure I get the most out of it,\N I'll need to include ****, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:15.74,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Okay, this should work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:27.26,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Damn it! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:29.47,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Olive oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:31.93,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Who the hell spilled this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:34.59,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Damn it! I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:38.55,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Washtub!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:43.87,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Who the hell set up a prank like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.99,0:18:48.91,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,That's a perfect container for the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:53.44,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Wait, this is a bit too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:57.41,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, wait... Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:12.66,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,Why was there an already-completed bomb here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.28,0:19:15.58,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,And what are these? Peanuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.97,0:19:17.70,main,Remnant,0,0,0,,A peanut bomb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:21.60,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:26.99,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,Are they working with the Thorn Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:27.89,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.33,0:19:30.81,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,A kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:34.10,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Red Circus guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:36.50,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,She knows who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:42.11,main,Anya,0,0,0,,If you've learned your lesson, \Nstay away from An—from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.59,0:19:44.87,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Got it? There won't be a next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.09,0:19:50.38,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You need to completely \Ngive up being a bad guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:55.12,main,Anya,0,0,0,,and make Cathurin a happy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:57.83,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,She even knows about Catherine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:01.30,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I guess she saw right through me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:03.25,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,Thorn Princess is a fearsome foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:07.87,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I can't believe she's got an insane \Nkid like that working for her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:12.14,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,We live in completely different worlds.\N I'm not cut out for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:15.85,italics,Remnant,0,0,0,,I'm going to forget all this \Nand live a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.91,0:20:19.85,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The atmosphere in that \Nrestaurant was quite lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.85,0:20:22.23,main,Yor,0,0,0,,But everything was so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:23.47,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:27.09,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank goodness. She seems \Nto be in a much better mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.09,0:20:29.95,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I think I was able to protect the \Npeace of the Forgers for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.17,0:20:36.53,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,This is all thanks to Anya. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:39.65,main,Franky,0,0,0,,So, hey... Where'd you run off to earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:51.94,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Loid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.55,0:20:57.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Ever since I was little, I spent most of my \Ntime taking care of my brother or working,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:20:59.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,so I rarely ever had a chance to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:03.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.41,0:21:08.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You made me really happy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:11.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,If it's not too much trouble, \Nplease invite me out again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:14.96,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,When I'm not injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.48,0:21:19.14,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I would love to. Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:28.86,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, look! There's a traveling \Namusement park over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:30.96,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It might close soon, but let's go see it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:34.28,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! Anya wants to go \Non the Ferris wheel, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.28,0:21:35.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,And the amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.60,0:21:38.98,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! I thought we were \Ntailing them! Are we done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.99,0:21:51.80,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Why, though?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.99,0:21:55.50,sign_31457_339_The_medicine__po,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2\pos(320,285)}The medicine (poison) had worn off
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:55.69,italicstop,Narrator,0,0,0,,The medicine—that is, \Nthe poison—had worn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:21:58.89,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I don't understand women.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:18.04,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:27.94,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.79,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.87,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:45.46,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.39,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.55,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:58.09,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:23:05.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.68,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.97,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:14.00,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.54,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:21.60,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:29.48,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:40.01,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx56\pos(380,256)}BOND'S STRATEGY TO STAY ALIVE\N DAMIAN'S FIELD RESEARCH TRIP
